<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Node.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">void SilikoNodeNegate(
    SilikoNode *object);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The `SilikoSyntaxTreeNegate` function negates the value of a syntax
tree node.

* `SyntaxTree` is the syntax tree to negate.
</para>
